# Implementation Plan — Slug-Based Routing Migration (SEO & Tech Debt)

Migrate OdysseyCart product detail page URLs from database `_id` hashes (`/items/6645a7b...`) to search-engine-optimized, human-readable slugs (`/items/artisan-ceramic-vase`). This improves SEO, URL readability, shareability, and user experience.

---

## 🎯 Objectives
1. **SEO Improvement**: Clean, keyword-rich URLs (`/items/minimalist-leather-wallet`).
2. **Dynamic Metadata**: Generate metadata (`generateMetadata`) per product for title, description, and OpenGraph images.
3. **Backward Compatibility**: Automatically handle requests to legacy `_id` URLs by redirecting (301/308) to the proper slug.
4. **DRY Link Consistency**: Ensure all store UI components (`ProductCard`, `CartItem`, `Wishlist`, `EditorialCard`, `AdminReviewList`, etc.) render clean slug-based links.

---

