| `app/(main)/items/[id]` → `app/(main)/items/[slug]` | **Rename Directory**: Move dynamic route parameter from `[id]` to `[slug]`. |
| `app/(main)/items/[slug]/page.tsx` | **Refactor Page**: Use `getProductBySlug(resolvedParams.slug)`. Add `_id` fallback & 301 redirect guard. Implement `generateMetadata`. |
