## 🛠️ Step-by-Step Execution Plan

### Step 1: Directory & Route Migration
1. Rename directory:
   `app/(main)/items/[id]` ➔ `app/(main)/items/[slug]`
2. Refactor `app/(main)/items/[slug]/page.tsx`:
   - Change `params: Promise<{ slug: string }>`
   - Query product with `getProductBySlug(resolvedParams.slug)`
   - **Legacy ID Redirect Guard**:
     ```ts
     if (!product) {
       // Check if param is valid MongoDB ObjectId
       if (mongoose.Types.ObjectId.isValid(resolvedParams.slug)) {
         const productById = await getProductById(resolvedParams.slug);
         if (productById?.slug) {
           redirect(`/items/${productById.slug}`);
         }
       }
       notFound();
     }
     ```

### Step 2: Dynamic SEO & Metadata Implementation
Add Next.js `generateMetadata` function in `app/(main)/items/[slug]/page.tsx`:
```ts
export async function generateMetadata({
  params,
}: {
  params: Promise<{ slug: string }>;
}): Promise<Metadata> {
  const { slug } = await params;
  const product = await getProductBySlug(slug);

  if (!product) return { title: "Product Not Found | OdysseyCart" };

  return {
    title: `${product.title} | OdysseyCart`,
    description: product.shortDescription,
    openGraph: {
      title: product.title,
      description: product.shortDescription,
      images: product.images?.[0] ? [{ url: product.images[0] }] : [],
    },
  };
}
```

### Step 3: Storefront Component Link Audit & Update
Update link paths in all components rendering product cards or detail links:
- `ProductCard.tsx`: `/items/${product.slug}`
- `EditorialCard.tsx`: `/items/${product.slug}`
- `CartItem.tsx`: `/items/${item.slug}`
- `AdminReviewList.tsx`: `/items/${product.slug}`
- `RelatedProducts.tsx`: `/items/${item.slug}`

### Step 4: Server Action & Revalidation Polish
In `app/actions/products.ts`:
- Ensure `getRelatedProducts` projects `slug: 1`.
- Update `revalidatePath` in `createProduct` and `updateProduct` to target `/items/${newSlug}`.

