## 🧪 Verification & Testing Strategy
1. **Slug Page Navigation**: Click any product card on `/items` or landing page to confirm it navigates to `/items/product-title-slug`.
2. **Backward Compatibility**: Manually visit `/items/<valid_mongodb_object_id>` in browser address bar and verify automatic redirect to `/items/<product_slug>`.
3. **SEO Check**: Inspect page source / `<head>` to verify dynamic `<title>` and `<meta name="description">`.
4. **Build & Type Check**: Run `npx tsc --noEmit` / `npm run build` to ensure zero broken imports or missing properties.

